 time, including a final full member-list/quorum check after the last node. The only blemish is leftover temporary install artifacts on all three nodes that were never cleaned up.","limitations":["No evidence of TLS/authentication configuration was requested by the task or observed; cluster runs with insecure client/peer traffic, which is acceptable since the task did not require encryption.","Temporary install files (tarball, extracted archive, reboot log) remain on /tmp on all three nodes; low risk but unaddressed."]},"ttft_ms":11264,"type":"result","duration_ms":45598,"uuid":"73f53734-d32a-4f68-b1f5-7b4f6ca94d15","ttft_stream_ms":2521,"time_to_request_ms":38,"first_content_frame_ms":2988,"queued_turn_count":0}
